/* ==================== Script 1271 id="amiyo-pe-s05" ==================== */
/* Pro Editing step 5: ALIGN TO PLAYHEAD. Select clips (any tracks), then Alt+Shift+[ lines up every clip START with the playhead, Alt+Shift+] lines up every clip END with it (also in Pr Tools). A clip that would land on top of another clip on its track is skipped and counted in the message. One undo step. */
