/* ==================== Script 1365 id="amiyo-export6-s09-verified" ==================== */
/* Export plan 2026-11, step 9 of 20 (Range and parts), checked with real exports of a red / green / blue picture (0-5 / 5-10 / 10-14 s) and a stepped tone (440 / 880 / 1320 Hz), then read back with ffprobe and measured from the saved frames and sound.
   Results: In -> Out (2-6 s), Selected clip, Custom (3-7, 2.5-6.5, 0:00:03-0:00:07), Playhead -> end and Start -> playhead all gave the right length and started and ended on the right colour and tone. Split into parts (5 s test parts of a 14 s edit) gave 5 / 5 / 4 s files (150 / 150 / 120 frames), each with the right picture and sound; "Start at part 2" made only parts 2 and 3; range + parts (1-12 s) gave 5 / 5 / 1 s. Bad custom times (text, start past the end, end before start, under half a second) keep Start export switched off with a plain message; In only or Out only work through the In -> Out button; the range resets to the whole edit each time the dialog opens; Cancel during part 1 stops the whole run with no stray file.
   Faults fixed: see "amiyo-export6-s09-range-parts-fixes" (long-edit "one file" line, negative custom time, lone In or Out point).
   Not testable here: a real 10-30 minute part (the test machine is too slow); the part length logic was checked on a 40 minute edit (4 parts of 10 min, 2 of 30 min, start-at-part limit). */window.AMIYO_EXPORT6_STEP=9;

