/* ==================== Script 1367 id="amiyo-export6-s11-verified" ==================== */
/* Export plan 2026-11, step 11 of 20 (Mixed media), checked with real exports read back with ffprobe/ffmpeg. Video + image + audio file on separate tracks plus an empty video track: 6 s file, picture right on every part (video, then the picture), sound from the video and then the audio file both heard, the empty track changes nothing. Audio-only project: a valid file with sound and a plain dark picture. Image-only project: 5 s MP4, no sound track. A gap between two clips: dark picture and silence for the gap, sound again for the second clip. An odd canvas (1001x563) is rounded up to even numbers. An empty project says "Nothing to export yet".
   Fault fixed: an edit shorter than 1 second always exported as 1 second (a 0.3 s clip gave a 1.02 s file with the rest padded). The export, the live-recorder fallback, the progress bar and the part splitter now use the real length (0.3 s gave 0.32 s, 0.1 s gave 0.12 s).
   Not tested here: audio-only files saved as plain sound (step 16). * / */window.AMIYO_EXPORT6_STEP=11;

