/* ==================== Script 1380 id="amiyo-dir-s01-plan-card" ==================== */
/* AI Director · Step 1 of 20 — a readable plan card for bigger requests.
   Before: requests that mention music, captions, "first N seconds", shorts or silence opened a box of raw JSON, and several
   steps ended with "unavailable locally — configure a connector" even when the editor can do them itself.
   Now: the request is split into plain steps you can tick or untick, run in order with a status for each step, and the whole
   request can be taken back with one "Undo all" (or by typing "undo that"). A step that fails is marked and the rest still run. */
